{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/24422f8b60206a0dcee6e3e7aeae9c98.avif?t=1757752167\" width=600 height=160 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Outcity</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outcity</strong> is a cozy sandbox farm simulator where you build your own countryside haven from scratch. As a new settler, transform wild lands into a thriving, personalized farm. Plant, build, and shape every corner \u2014 this land is now yours to flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/c39e543f32e4be661dafab5805661e72.poster.avif?t=1757752167\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/c39e543f32e4be661dafab5805661e72.webm?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/c39e543f32e4be661dafab5805661e72.mp4?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Unique Biomes and Expand Your Farm</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey to build the farm of your dreams will take you through lush fields, arid hills, and fertile lowlands. Each region offers exclusive crops, valuable resources, and endless expansion possibilities. Venture into new territories and let your creativity shape the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/5afa1562fafbaaaeb14605ecead1496d.poster.avif?t=1757752167\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/5afa1562fafbaaaeb14605ecead1496d.webm?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/5afa1562fafbaaaeb14605ecead1496d.mp4?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Nature with Deep Mechanics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is more than scenery \u2014 it's your ally in growth. From special seedlings to soils that respond to your care, every element contributes to your progress. Manipulate terrain, manage irrigation systems, plant strategically, and relax by fishing in tranquil lakes to discover secrets buried throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/c27a90b8d7b9836ca3ad9fe5f56ca3e6.poster.avif?t=1757752167\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/c27a90b8d7b9836ca3ad9fe5f56ca3e6.webm?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/c27a90b8d7b9836ca3ad9fe5f56ca3e6.mp4?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Treasures and Rare Resources</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary seeds and powerful tools await dedicated explorers scattered throughout the vast world. Collect, cultivate, and transform your property into something truly special. Venture into mysterious mines and underground caverns filled with precious minerals and unique artifacts. The more you invest in the land \u2014 and what lies beneath it \u2014 the greater the rewards it offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/bc3d1f73a30d2cc6fc26a7a694ac657b.poster.avif?t=1757752167\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/bc3d1f73a30d2cc6fc26a7a694ac657b.apng?t=1757752167\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >List of features/resources</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own dream farm</strong> from scratch on wild, untamed lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand across vast territories</strong> and unlock new areas filled with resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine mysterious underground caverns</strong> filled with precious gems and artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish in tranquil lakes</strong> and collect rare catches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize every detail</strong> of your farm with complete creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through deep systems</strong> and unlock meaningful upgrades as you prosper.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Get Outcity and get to work!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/7d529098380d83a6a8c2a2c7056b483c.poster.avif?t=1757752167\" width=584 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/7d529098380d83a6a8c2a2c7056b483c.webm?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638080/extras/7d529098380d83a6a8c2a2c7056b483c.mp4?t=1757752167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https:/